 ended in a resignation after White's H9."}]}, "audit": {"by": "Sonnet 5.5", "verdict": "clean", "reason": "libs.py parses a pasted board and prints each group's stones and liberty count (flagging groups with 2 or fewer), and count.py counts stones and enclosed territory after removing named dead stones. Both only inspect the current position and never generate, score or rank candidate moves or look ahead.", "stop": false}}